sangati mula-svabhava

  "brahman-sthalam-sthita"
  "mula-swarupa svabhava-abheda dharana-jivamsha-siddha"
  "sama-vishama-drishthanta sakshi-matra-yukta"
  "sphoTa-sthita purna-abheda"
  "svayambhu-siddha iccha-sthita niralamba-siddha"
  "bija-nyasa-abheda viraha-sthita"

shabda root-nature / latent-potential

done
